1
00:00:00,202 --> 00:00:11,098
(Q31) Today we continue our series on ecology and conservation with a look at a particularly endangered member of the black bear family.

2
00:00:11,098 --> 00:00:21,275
[Q31答案句] One in ten black bears is actually born with a white coat which is the result of a special gene that surfaces in a few.

3
00:00:21,275 --> 00:00:25,271
(Q32) Local people have named it the spirit bear.

4
00:00:25,271 --> 00:00:33,069
[Q32答案句] And according to the legends of these communities, its snowy fur brings with it a special power.

5
00:00:33,069 --> 00:00:43,154
(Q33) Because of this, it has always been highly regarded by them -so much that they do not speak of seeing it to anyone else.

6
00:00:43,154 --> 00:00:48,088
[Q33答案句] It is their way of protecting it when strangers visit the area.

7
00:00:48,088 --> 00:00:51,853
(Q34) The white bear's habitat is quite interesting.

8
00:00:51,853 --> 00:00:58,395
The bear's strong relationship with the old- growth rainforest is a complex one.

9
00:00:58,395 --> 00:01:05,673
The white bear relies on the huge centuries-old trees in the forest in many ways.

10
00:01:05,673 --> 00:01:16,535
[Q34答案句] For example, the old-growth trees have extremely Iong roots that help prevent erosion of the soil along the banks of the many fish streams.

11
00:01:16,535 --> 00:01:25,706
(Q35) Keeping these banks intact is important because these streams are home to salmon, which are the bear's main food source.

12
00:01:25,706 --> 00:01:30,988
In return, the bear's feeding habits nurture the forest.

13
00:01:30,988 --> 00:01:41,135
As the bears eat the salmon, they discard the skin and bones in great amounts on the forest floor, which provide vital nutrients.

14
00:01:41,135 --> 00:01:52,154
These produce lush vegetation that sustains thousands of other types of life forms, from birds to insects and more.

15
00:01:52,154 --> 00:02:00,321
[Q35答案句] Today, the spirit bear lives off the coast of the province of British Columbia on a few islands.

16
00:02:00,321 --> 00:02:08,973
(Q36) There is great concern for their survival since it is estimated that less than two hundred of these white bears remain.

17
00:02:08,973 --> 00:02:24,833
The best way to protect them is to make every effort to preserve the delicate balance of their forest environment - in other words, their ecosystem.

18
00:02:24,833 --> 00:02:30,671
The greatest threat to the bear's existence is the loss of its habitat.

19
00:02:30,671 --> 00:02:38,367
Over many years, logging companies have stripped the land by cutting down a large number of trees.

20
00:02:38,367 --> 00:02:49,867
[Q36答案句] In addition, they have built roads which have fractured the areas where the bear usually feeds, and many hibernation sites have also been lost.

21
00:02:49,867 --> 00:02:56,547
(Q37) The logging of the trees along the streams has damaged the places where the bears fish.

22
00:02:56,547 --> 00:03:06,683
[Q37答案句] To make matters worse, the number of salmon in those streams is declining because there is no legal limit on fishing at the moment.

23
00:03:06,683 --> 00:03:23,816
(Q38) [Q38答案句] All these influences have a negative impact on the spirit bear's very existence, which is made all the more fragile by the fact that reproduction among these bears has always been disappointingly low.

24
00:03:23,816 --> 00:03:28,248
(Q39) And so, what's the situation going forward?

25
00:03:28,248 --> 00:03:37,079
Community organizations, environmental groups and the British Columbia government are now working together on the problem.

26
00:03:37,079 --> 00:03:45,930
[Q39答案句] The government is now requiring logging companies to adopt a better logging method, which is a positive step.

27
00:03:45,930 --> 00:03:55,627
(Q40) However, these measures alone may not be sufficient to ensure a healthy population of the spirit bear in the future.

28
00:03:55,627 --> 00:04:07,881
[Q40答案句] Other steps also need to be taken. While it is important to maintain the spirit bear's habitat, there also needs to be more emphasis on its expansion.

29
00:04:07,881 --> 00:04:10,381
The move is justified as it will also create space for other bears that are losing their homes ...?

